<title>USA: Georgia sees Vogtle 2 nuke out until Oct 12.</title>
<headline>Georgia sees Vogtle 2 nuke out until Oct 12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>As part of a refueling maintenance outage, Georgia Power Co's 1,162 megawatt (MW) Vogtle nuclear unit 2 went off line on Sunday afternoon, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>The Waynesboro, Ga., unit is scheduled to be off line until October 12, said company spokeswoman Loretto Stevens.</p>
<p>Georgia Power's unit 1, also with a generating capacity of 1,162 MW, is operating at full power, she added.</p>
<p>Georgia Power is a unit of Southern Co.</p>
<p>-- New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
